    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG - Castleknock are delighted to present 45 The Courtyard, which is an impressive three-bed, townhouse, benefiting from a westerly orientation, located within a secure and gated development.\n\nMeasuring approx. 101.5sq m / 1,092sq ft of well-proportioned accommodation and light filled living spaces. Offering accommodation of entrance hall with guest toilet, an inviting light filled living / dining room, kitchen / breakfast room leading to west facing communal gardens. On the first floor you have two double bedrooms and family bathroom. On the second floor you have a large double bedroom with en-suite and large private west facing balcony that is not overlooked.\n\nOne of the outstanding features of this property is the wonderful, sun-drenched, west facing, extensive patio area on offer. To the front there is ample residents parking available.\n\nThe Courtyard is a modern residential development, which is easily accessible to a host of amenities, such as well serviced high frequency bus routes, good transport links; N3/M3/M50 providing direct access to the Airport / City Centre and national roads network, Connolly Hospital, excellent schools and recreational facilities and is within walking distance of the Blanchardstown Shopping Centre. The Phoenix Park is only a 15 minute drive away and Clonsilla & Coolmine Train Stations easily accessible with connections to both the Luas and DART.\n\nViewing is a must."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nKitchen/Breakfast Room - 3.74m x 2.25m\nWith fitted wall and base units.\n\nLiving Room - 5.57m x 4.35m\nInviting room with laminate floorring, tv point and double door access to west facing gardens.\n\nGuest Wc - 1.29m x 0.89m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.71m x 4.14m\nDouble room with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.66m x 2.77m\nDouble room with fitted wardrobes.\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.31m x 1.98m\nWc, whb, bath with shower and window for natural ventilation.\n\nBedroom 3 (top floor) - 5m x 4.43m\nLarge double room with fitted wardrobes, tv point and wood flooring. Access to top floor west facing balcony.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.29m x 1.40m\nWc, whb and shower.\n\nBalcony - 2.34m x 2.08m\nLarge west facing private balcony that is not overlooked.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Built c. 2000</li><li> 101.5sq m / 1,092sq ft</li><li> Three double bedrooms</li><li> Three bathrooms to include main bathroom, en-suite and guest toilet</li><li> Ready for immediate occupancy</li><li> Upgraded high level energy efficient electric heating</li><li> Double glazed windows</li><li> Recently fitted Composite front door and double patio doors</li><li> Barna shed to the rear gardens</li><li> Burglar alarm</li><li> West facing rear</li><li> Secure & gated development</li><li> Residents parking to the front</li><li> Quiet enclave location</li><li> Well serviced by public transport</li><li> Within close proximity of every conceivable amenity</li><li> Management Company - Gracemount Management Company Limited</ul>"
      },
      {
